#: scenario2:scenario2_1E6C256C_B493_478B_9873_8BF3B45AB41F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72b4cc3c70a3c54fcc2e2b325e2f63320ff1d97930680691f615fe6325b1dbb9
#. default-sha256: 03ad578f4689ab1472d6b3ab29f8b3ecc2fd6809e8b2e33769aaac3c6e251b46
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1E6C256C_B493_478B_9873_8BF3B45AB41F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Without exception, everyone who had wandered into the mansion "
"had lost their lives before the sun rose the next morning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Sans exception, tous les visiteurs qui s’étaient aventurés "
"jusqu’au manoir avaient perdu la vie avant le lever du soleil."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C93420F3_8FFA_40B7_B856_1FE1F8A0466F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb133224965ed02b52b5122fb629b1026babae0ba7ff16b95a16a76f3366b23e
#. default-sha256: d4464dca7439cfdfbce9458ae17a22913d391adef2dcab94d5f742b0b55c26ae
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C93420F3_8FFA_40B7_B856_1FE1F8A0466F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was the first visitor who had not met this fate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle fut la première à ne pas connaître le même sort."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CAC6C91A_DD29_4811_9238_F2717385F7F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a6bf10823b670295153bd9683c36764be64324789a9f24a28a3993eff01071f
#. default-sha256: 660acad896d48ad12dcbaf640c2d114df5dd1622c469464bef46baf61bdb11f2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CAC6C91A_DD29_4811_9238_F2717385F7F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Over time, Bestia’s madness gradually subsided; ⟪k:1⟫he even began to seem rather tame. ⟪k:2⟫"
"You would hardly believe it was the same beast who had once reveled in those perverse festivities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avec le temps, la folie de Bestia s’atténua peu à peu ; ⟪k:1⟫il paraissait presque dompté, "
"même. ⟪k:2⟫On n’aurait pas cru que c’était la même bête qui se délectait de festivités perverses."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1D47DDF0_66D0_43BB_9984_D2296BE1DCDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fb2e5956376e9f68a847263bb794b209b05ba6b6ce257fdf3800cfc94df1790
#. default-sha256: 2c758ad58f5e7a6a41a55294bd6454151a0eb76f5b0857ae80065b64bf60b8f0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1D47DDF0_66D0_43BB_9984_D2296BE1DCDC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was, I imagine, at a loss for how to behave."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je pense qu’il ne savait plus très bien comment se comporter."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1FE82314_7A96_4ED8_9B20_9E78C3AB7AA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48eb7034e9d70abc50edc12a7eecc2167dfc02ca152eaafda57810cee5630f83
#. default-sha256: f54ffad7e5f0113e71f4275e20675335cd6ba65d66ffbc148ee4f24487fb8a2c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1FE82314_7A96_4ED8_9B20_9E78C3AB7AA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I too would be flustered in the constant presence of such beauty."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Moi aussi, j’aurais été troublée par la présence constante d’une telle beauté."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E0F46256_924E_4B46_9D3D_844EE9C51BC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccab33b321f01b869d86987bac80588fab47d52be44dfe0cea4038c77dafd12e
#. default-sha256: 56d51d1eee38e773748427b9191b4aef0b5bed6e35aa18571e093799f406762c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E0F46256_924E_4B46_9D3D_844EE9C51BC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not just her appearance; ⟪k:1⟫she had said she wished to live with him—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"a beast who had committed countless atrocities. ⟪k:4⟫Perplexing indeed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais ce n’était pas seulement son apparence ; ⟪k:1⟫elle avait dit qu’elle souhaitait vivre à "
"ses côtés—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ une bête qui avait commis d’innombrables atrocités. ⟪k:4⟫Déconcertant, en "
"effet."

