#: scenario2:scenario2_BCBD67FC_A76D_41C8_85A8_CB3C53F9EF2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70ef009f98d5ac3cbbb1ac4372c77333d11a487f6b8f498fd98c3241f3f5bb59
