msgid "⟪k:0⟫(“Horrible”? I’m ⟪k:1⟫aware⟪k:2⟫ that what I’ve done is wrong?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(« Horribles » ? Je ⟪k:1⟫sais⟪k:2⟫ que ce que j’ai fait est mal ?)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_215A2D46_B2AB_4C00_8D11_BCA5D5A8AF86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1d5b8cc8909c392047f06a80ecc64e84f8cec50303887e08f51c64d5ab9ea00
